      "note": "smoke resolution: loose tolerances (gtol 1e-2), budgets do not bind, optimizers stop in ~5-219 steps; cheap diagnostics tier. The scipy-jax-fullgraph mpol2 cells double as the Phase 0 GATE smoke (inspect their result JSON for passed=true)."
    },
    "mpol10": {
