      "runnable_now": false,
      "note": "production resolution: tolerances tighten (gtol 1e-7), 1500/50 budgets bind; requires --warm-start-run-dir from the continuation donor build (2->4->6->8->10 ladder via --intermediate-rungs). Both host-SciPy lanes compile only one value/grad eval per step, so node memory is bounded by a single eval rather than the whole optimization (no monolithic jit)."
    }
  },
